---
title: Studio Satsuma
---
<main class="home">
  <header class="hero">
    <h1><span class="studio">Studio</span> Satsuma</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Small apps, grown in Brooklyn.</p>
  </header>

  {#
    TREE PLACEHOLDER. The interactive satsuma tree (tree.njk + tree.js, build
    step 2 of docs/spec-2026-11-rebrand.md) renders here, between the tagline
    and the hint line. Until then this is an empty, static box of the tree's
    final size. The project list below is the canonical content either way.
  #}
  <div class="tree" data-tree-placeholder></div>
  <p class="hint">Pick a ripe one.</p>

  <section class="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-heading">
    <h2 id="projects-heading">Projects</h2>
    <ul>
      {% for project in collections.projects %}
      <li>
        {% if project.data.icon %}<img class="project-icon" src="{{ project.data.icon }}" alt="" width="40" height="40">{% endif %}
        <span class="name">{% if project.url %}<a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ project.data.title }}{% endif %}</span>
        <span class="status">{{ project.data.status | statusWord }}</span>
        <span class="one-line">{{ project.data.oneLine }}</span>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p class="services">
    Shipped a prototype with AI and hit the wall? We make it scale, and help you
    build the team that keeps it that way.
    <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
  </p>
</main>
